{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":18,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["關於古實的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["古實河那邊、翅膀刷刷作響之地有禍了！"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"那裡派出的使節乘蘆葦船行駛在水面上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迅捷的使節啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去身材高大、皮膚光滑、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遠近畏懼、強悍好戰、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境內河流縱橫的民族那裡吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"天下萬民啊，普世的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山上豎立旗幟的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要看；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"號角吹響的時候，你們要聽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華對我說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我要從我的居所靜靜地觀看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無聲無息，就像烈日下閃爍的熱氣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如夏收時節露水蒸發的雲霧。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在收割之前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"花已凋謝、葡萄將熟之時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必用刀削去葡萄樹的嫩枝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"砍掉蔓延的枝條。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必全部被拋給山野間的鷙鳥和走獸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"夏天被鷙鳥啄食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"冬天被走獸吞吃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"那時，這身材高大、皮膚光滑、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遠近畏懼、強悍好戰、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境內河流縱橫的民族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必帶著禮物來到錫安山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華立名之地。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/18.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/19.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/17.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}